418..493 Comment "/// The sum of two integers (cubical\'s `_+_` on `ℤ`), by recursion on the"
494..568 Comment "/// second. It respects `Int`\'s rules: at `S(P(x))` it builds `S(P(plus(a,"
569..623 Comment "/// x)))`, which the first rule reads as `plus(a, x)`."
