1776..1853 Comment "/// The sum commutes (cubical\'s `+Comm`), by induction on the second summand,"
1854..1928 Comment "/// each step the recursive call carried along `up` or `down` and then the"
1929..2006 Comment "/// summand brought out of the left. The arms compose to no conversion of the"
2007..2081 Comment "/// answer at `x`, yet `Int` is a set, so its rules are respected by their"
2082..2102 Comment "/// endpoints alone."
